            <ArticleTitle>[Shoulder pain and shoulder stiffness: causes, differential diagnosis and therapy:].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>373-82</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Like lumbago, pains and stiffness of the shoulder are a crux medicorum. Here, however, unlike lumbago, promising treatment is possible if a correct diagnosis made. The cardial symptoms are classified for the diagnosis; conservative and surgical treatment of the individual disease pictures are described.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
